UnitIcmInterfaces
├── when checking the pinned selectors
│   ├── given the receiveTokens function
│   │   └── it matches the literal selector
│   └── given the sendAndCall function
│       └── it matches the literal selector
├── when checking the struct layout
│   ├── given the canonical tuple type string
│   │   └── it reproduces the interface selector
│   └── given two fields swapped
│       └── it no longer reproduces the interface selector
└── when encoding a call
    └── it decodes every field with the pinned layout
